## Key Concepts

- End-to-end latency, tail latency, and SLA adherence
- Multi-region traffic distribution and data locality
- Isolation strategies, fault-injection, and controlled backpressure
- Distributed tracing, instrumentation, and data-driven debugging
- Realistic workload modeling and ramp planning

